# corvus formatting. Google base = the Highway idiom the code already
# follows (2-space indent, 80 columns, `T* p`, two spaces before trailing
# comments). Overrides protect what a formatter must not touch:
#  - SortIncludes/IncludeBlocks: include order is load-bearing around
#    hwy/foreach_target.h and the -inl.h toggle guards.
#  - ReflowComments: the derivation blocks are hand-wrapped maths.
#  - IndentPPDirectives: the existing code keeps directives in column 0.
BasedOnStyle: Google
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 80
SortIncludes: Never
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
ReflowComments: Never
IndentPPDirectives: None
